flowchart TD
    A[Open Discover] --> B{Choose input}
    B -->|Suggested topic| C[Review topic assumptions]
    B -->|Keywords / question| C
    B -->|Seed paper / Zotero collection| C

    C --> D[Generate candidate pool]
    D --> E[Resolve IDs and versions]
    E --> F[Classify roles and optimize diversity]
    F --> G[Balanced Reading Pack]

    G --> H{User edits pack?}
    H -->|Replace / pin / correct role| F
    H -->|Start reading| I{PDF available?}

    I -->|Zotero or local| J[Open Reader]
    I -->|Legal OA source| K[Download and verify]
    I -->|No legal PDF| L[Open source page / manual import]
    K --> M[Attach or link in Zotero]
    L --> M
    M --> J

    J --> N[Pre-read guide]
    N --> O[Read / highlight / ask]
    O --> P[Create Evidence Anchor]
    P --> Q[AI produces structured Draft]
    Q --> R{Human review}
    R -->|Accept| S[Verified knowledge]
    R -->|Edit| S
    R -->|Reject| O

    S --> T{Finish paper?}
    T -->|No| O
    T -->|Yes| U[Post-read cognitive delta]
    U --> V[Preview Zotero and Git writes]
    V --> W[Sync / commit]
    W --> X{At least two verified papers?}
    X -->|No| G
    X -->|Yes| Y[Proposition Matrix and synthesis]
    Y --> Z[Next paper / research question / experiment task]
    Z --> G
